<!-- The Kettenblatt mark for themed icons: the same chainring, drawn in code in the same spirit as
     map/Markers.kt. Five circles and two rings, no bitmap.

     Geometry is the design spec's 100-unit viewport scaled by 0.68 into the
     108dp adaptive canvas, which puts the outer teeth at r=33.7 — inside
     the 72dp safe circle every launcher mask respects.

     The spider holes and the bore are punched out with evenOdd rather than
     filled with the background colour, so the same paths work as a themed
     monochrome icon, where the system tints every opaque pixel. -->
